# Architecture gates

Follow `TARGET_ARCHITECTURE.md` and `.cursor/skills/ledgercraft-architecture/SKILL.md`.

- Request path: Client → Hono → use case → repository → Drizzle → PostgreSQL
- No new `supabase.from`, Storage SDK, Edge Function, or client OpenAI/Resend calls
- DTOs from Zod contracts; never expose Drizzle types to clients
- Ownership IDs from session/membership, never from the body
- Do not replay existing Git SQL onto empty Postgres; reconstruct from app types
- Do not mix UI redesign, TanStack Router, `apps/` moves, and data cutover
- After each wave: run `.cursor/skills/ledgercraft-knowledge-sync/SKILL.md`
- Launch specialists via `.cursor/skills/ledgercraft-agent-roster/SKILL.md`
- Session start: `.cursor/skills/ledgercraft-bootstrap/SKILL.md`
- Feature proof: `.cursor/skills/ledgercraft-verify/SKILL.md`
